SUMMARY:Help Bring Blue Note Junction to Life-Community Night
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an inspiring evening at One World West to learn more about Blue Note Junction and how it will bring together affordable housing\, the arts\, wellness\, and community-driven entrepreneurship under one roof\, with plans for a commercial/commissary kitchen + market\, co-working + counseling\, an outdoor community spa\, performing arts\, and retail shops. .\nMore than a building\, BNJ is designed to be a cornerstone of Western North Carolina’s entrepreneurial ecosystem and a regenerative investment in community\, culture\, and local prosperity.\nDuring the event\, HHF co-founder DeWayne Barton will present the Blue Note Junction vision and what it means for the future of our community. We’ll introduce the Hood Huggers Foundation’s work and its impact\, and participants of our programs will share their stories. Guests will also enjoy live music by Destro and Virtuous\, and Yasira and Gabriel from the El Bodegon food truck will be there offering Argentinean comfort food.\nIt’ll be a chance to connect with staff\, board members\, partners\, and supporters who are helping make this vision possible. Watch the Blue Note Junction rendering so you get as excited as we are!\nNo Cover
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/help-bring-blue-note-junction-to-life-community-night/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,DJ/Electronic,Live Music
